f98cdb2fc47f9a1c613c673bfc2255adc31546df:docs/papers/radial-statistical-counterexample/index.html:51:      <p><strong>Unrefereed, AI-assisted preprint.</strong> The candidate was supplied as AI-generated work. The manuscript, computations, and separate adversarial AI reviews were prepared with OpenAI Codex. These reviews are not external human peer review or a full proof-assistant formalization. Published on Zenodo on 26 September 2026: <a href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22983519">10.5281/zenodo.22983519</a>. The download kit preserves the original pre-deposit snapshot.</p>
